    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22013" root="شر" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرِّيرٌ</span></b>  (S, A, K) <i>Abounding in</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرّ</span> [or <i>evil</i> or
<i>wrongdoing</i> &amp;c.; <i>very evil</i> &amp;c.]; applied to a man:
(S, A:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرِّيرُونَ</span> (K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْرَارٌ</span>, which latter is
anomalous. (Ham. p. 699.)

